{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"pen_barn","model_identifier":"pen_barn","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# pen_barn\n\nPen and barn: a big timber barn with double doors, a hay loft with a hay door above, and a fenced pen in front.\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 10 columns (160 x 160 units, 4.50 x 4.50 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -74..74, y 0..155, z -74..75 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 84, construction_0 24, construction_33 34, construction_66 48, ruined 21 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- barn: 100 x 156 x 76 centred at x 0, z 36\n- pen: fence ring 144 x 18 x 70 at z -37 (walk-through for herded animals only)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `pen_barn_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `pen_barn_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_pen_barn` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -10)\n- `slot_pen` at (0, 0, -36)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"barn_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-50.0,0.0,-2.0],"to":[50.0,3.0,74.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,446.0,100.0,449.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[100.0,446.0,176.0,449.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,446.0,100.0,449.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[100.0,446.0,176.0,449.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[35.0,161.0,135.0,237.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[35.0,161.0,135.0,237.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a5cc7b9c-224f-5306-b8e8-c0ccdf705032"},{"name":"barn_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48.0,3.0,0.0],"to":[48.0,99.0,4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[17.0,0.0,113.0,96.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[201.0,0.0,205.0,96.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[17.0,0.0,113.0,96.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[201.0,0.0,205.0,96.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[48.0,421.0,144.0,425.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[48.0,421.0,144.0,425.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"cb337eba-8e66-5bc7-9fe1-c7c12da1a07c"},{"name":"barn_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48.0,3.0,68.0],"to":[48.0,99.0,72.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[17.0,0.0,113.0,96.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[205.0,0.0,209.0,96.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[17.0,0.0,113.0,96.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[205.0,0.0,209.0,96.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[144.0,421.0,240.0,425.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[144.0,421.0,240.0,425.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4a90a26c-0409-5b3e-8716-3c7897a91a06"},{"name":"barn_w0_w","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"ligh